// One declaration, medium-free. It names what the operator is doing and what
// the values mean, and says nothing about how any channel renders it.
//
// This file is never edited by the comparison. Each projection appends a VIBE
// naming its medium and nothing else -- which is the claim under test: that a
// declaration survives a change of channel without being rewritten for it.

DEFINE INTENT_FLOW review_overdue_invoices (
  SATISFIES [DISCOVER, LOCATE, SCAN, COMPARE, READ],
  SIGNALS [danger, warning, muted]
)
